# REST and secrets

## Auth
- Staging only: `https://tcstaging.truth-collective.com`
- Env: `TC_WP_USER` + `TC_WP_APP_PASSWORD`
- Username that works: WordPress **email** `dreid1253@yahoo.com` (not slug variants)
- Before any page write: `GET /wp-json/wp/v2/users/me?context=edit` must be **200**
- On 401: stop. Follow `diagnostics/REST-AUTH-GATE-2026-08-19.md`. Do not guess passwords into git or tickets.

## Writes
- Backup current `content.raw` under `diagnostics/backups/` before risky POST
- Prefer one page family per worker session
- Set Astra `meta.site-post-title` to `disabled` on light-rebuilt pages to avoid dual H1
- Do not change published/indexed slugs

## Secrets hygiene
- Never commit Application Passwords or `.env` values
- Never put live secrets in diagnostics beyond “set / refresh secret named X”
- Regenerating App Password is Daniel’s WP Admin action; agents only document the steps
